  "scavengers": {
    "_doc": "C3: the things that eat the dead. An idle scavenger (not hunting, not searching, awake) that smells a corpse within 'reach' tiles goes to it and eats it in 'eat_turns' turns, healing 'heal_share' of its health; the corpse is gone, so a harvest is a race. Ghouls ate the dead in the old stories; vermin and oozes eat anything.",
